<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Renaissance of RNNs in Streaming Clinical Time Series: Compact Recurrence Remains Competitive with Transformers
<br class="ltx_break"></h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
